[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3155793935","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109338#issuecomment-3155793935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","id":3155793935,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68GZgP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T16:19:03Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T16:25:15Z","body":"This is by design, to avoid storing unnecessary data and to ensure setting it to the default will update with changes, but would be useful to be able to ensure it keeps the old default and not change with updates\n\nSo changing this unconditionally, i.e. saving all settings without having it be something you can configure, would break compatibility and create a *lot* of clutter as there are *many* project settings","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3155793935/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160201942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109338#issuecomment-3160201942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","id":3160201942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68XNrW","user":{"login":"lucho1","id":11302677,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzAyNjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11302677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1","html_url":"https://github.com/lucho1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T13:33:35Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T13:35:18Z","body":"I see, I might understand that for null values (although I have some doubts of why wouldn't you be able to have a setting set to a null value), but I think that we should be able to have a property that can be false without it being deleted from the settings, after all it's a valid value.\n\nI'm also specifically thinking about the case (which we use a lot in my studio), where you set a setting to a given value, for example, on the startup of any plugin. If that value is a boolean, and you initialize it to true:\n\n```\nif !ProjectSettings.has_setting(\"setting\"):\n\t\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\"setting\", true)\n```\n\nYou will see the \"reset to default\" icon in that setting. You would then assume that the default value of that setting is false and therefore can mislead you to clicking on it instead of just marking it as false. In the insides, though, what will happen is that Godot will delete that setting and then on the next startup that setting will be created again and set to true.\n\nI mean it's quite a minor thing, I don't want to be peaky and I wouldn't prioritize it much, but I have already seen some cases of this being confusing in my studio or causing some minor issues.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160201942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160501205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109338#issuecomment-3160501205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","id":3160501205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68YWvV","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-06T14:50:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T14:51:00Z","body":"This shouldn't happen if the custom project setting is properly declared in an editor plugin, e.g. like this:\n\nhttps://github.com/godot-extended-libraries/godot-debug-menu/blob/0e5f15217285c76170039c9cefcf79c8ab0ec6b3/addons/debug_menu/plugin.gd#L9-L15\n\nIf the project setting is not declared as such, Godot can't know whether it's a custom project setting or a leftover obsolete setting from an older Godot version (many projects upgraded from Godot 3 still have such settings present).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3160501205/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3162911033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109338#issuecomment-3162911033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","id":3162911033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68hjE5","user":{"login":"lucho1","id":11302677,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzAyNjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11302677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1","html_url":"https://github.com/lucho1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucho1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T07:36:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T07:36:55Z","body":"Okay, so using `ProjectSettings.add_property_info()` should avoid this? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3162911033/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164111849","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109338#issuecomment-3164111849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109338","id":3164111849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68mIPp","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T13:05:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T13:05:54Z","body":"> Okay, so using `ProjectSettings.add_property_info()` should avoid this?\n\nYes, it should as long as it's being run within the editor somehow (EditorPlugin or `@tool` script).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3164111849/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]